{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlrxwfo0ths0","created":1790699234405,"text":"模型评估与选择","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlrxwp9i6u80","created":1790699255295,"text":"经验误差与过拟合"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlscyokpmow0","created":1790741727173,"text":"错误率"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczsa9vu00","created":1790741813613,"text":"分类错误占总数的比例"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlscyt9o37c0","created":1790741737389,"text":"精度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlscztrv9gw0","created":1790741816853,"text":"精度=1-错误率"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlscz0ade4o0","created":1790741752670,"text":"经验误差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczurghi80","created":1790741819005,"text":"学习器在训练集上的误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsczf6lnxk0","created":1790741785093,"text":"泛化误差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczvmxx7k0","created":1790741820909,"text":"学习器在新数据集上的误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsczgfc1aw0","created":1790741787797,"text":"过拟合"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczxgfqq00","created":1790741824869,"text":"学习能力太强，特性也作为判断标准"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlscznepfqo0","created":1790741802997,"text":"欠拟合"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczyt4jew0","created":1790741827813,"text":"学习能力太差，有一个特征便判断正确"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxwro0zw80","created":1790699260527,"text":"评估方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd4hkspog0","created":1790742182125,"text":"留出法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd55hp8o00","created":1790742234181,"text":"采用分层采样法，测试集和训练集都是一半正例一半反例"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsd4jdronk0","created":1790742186054,"text":"k折交叉验证"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd56fpels0","created":1790742236237,"text":"样本分成k份，k-1份训练，1份测试，得到k轮数据"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsd4mxphps0","created":1790742193790,"text":"自助法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd57mfwbk0","created":1790742238821,"text":"有放回的从m个样本中取出m个样本作为训练集，只要轮数够多，就有36.8%的数据取不到，作为测试集，其余作为训练集。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdi2hed140","created":1790743246366,"text":"也叫自助采样法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdiuqtdao0","created":1790743307886,"text":"外包估计"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsdizyoxo80","created":1790743319246,"text":"实际评估的模型与期望评估的模型都使用m个训练样本，而我们仍有数据总量约1/3的、没有在训练集中出现的样本用于测试"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsd58zimwo0","created":1790742241789,"text":"调参与最终模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd5kryr080","created":1790742267453,"text":"在进行模型评估与选择时，除了要对适用学习算法进行选择，还需对算法参数进行设定,就是通常所说的“参数调节”或简称“调参”。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxwt5h9uo0","created":1790699263759,"text":"比较检验","expandState":"expand","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-19.999999701976776,"y":63.999999046325684}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsizg15dhc0","created":1790758713599,"text":"统计假设检验"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsizycwxqw0","created":1790758753493,"text":"通过样本数据判断总体参数假设是否成立的统计推断方法"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsizh61w9s0","created":1790758716072,"text":"单个学习器"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlsizhzf80o0","created":1790758717848,"text":"两个学习器"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlsj0i73my80","created":1790758796677,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxz1erluw0","created":1790699438463,"text":"偏差与方差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf96tvfz40","created":1790748192770,"text":"泛化误差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf97e9jns0","created":1790748194003,"text":"泛化误差=偏差+方差+噪声"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsf98izyqo0","created":1790748196466,"text":"偏差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsh83uo8go0","created":1790753750144,"text":"偏差度量了学习算法的期望预测与真实结果的偏离程度，偏差大代表欠拟合"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsf9ac3g000","created":1790748200402,"text":"方差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlshhrigvf40","created":1790754506926,"text":"方差度量了同样大小的训练集的变动所导致的学习性能的变化，方差大代表过拟合"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsh7tqz6600","created":1790753728152,"text":"噪声"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlshhyrrxq00","created":1790754522726,"text":"噪声则表达了在当前任务上任何学习算法所能达到的期望泛化误差的下界，即刻画了学习问题本身的难度"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxwscxpmw0","created":1790699262033,"text":"性能度量"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsdkf8zrvc0","created":1790743430885,"text":"回归任务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsdpwfw0z40","created":1790743860128,"text":"常用的性能度量为均方误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdkg4vs4g0","created":1790743432813,"text":"二分类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsdoczmgf40","created":1790743739421,"text":"将一对样本根据概率p分为正类与负类，这就是二分类"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdkgxuy4w0","created":1790743434565,"text":"查准率"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf11rkrnk0","created":1790747554834,"text":"样本中拿到正例样本的数量除以我拿走的所有样本的数量，简写为P"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdkhw93yw0","created":1790743436645,"text":"查全率"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf12jmrhc0","created":1790747556530,"text":"样本中拿到正例样本的数量除以原样本中所有正例样本的数量，简写为R"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdkz1m00g0","created":1790743473974,"text":"P-R曲线"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf14z7nyo0","created":1790747561826,"text":"学习器对样本的预测结果从最可能为正例，到最不可能是正例进行排序，计算出查准率和查全率，从而构建P-R曲线"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdl1xzk080","created":1790743480285,"text":"平衡点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf15ucy800","created":1790747563709,"text":"查准率与查全率相同的点，可以粗略比较学习器的优良"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdl33516o0","created":1790743482773,"text":"F1度量"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf16k3yt40","created":1790747565266,"text":"更好的比较学习器优良的性能度量"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdtdud05s0","created":1790744133101,"text":"ROC曲线与AUC"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf17dve8g0","created":1790747567066,"text":"根据真正例率与假正例率的值，对真正例率进行排序所描绘的曲线，AUC是曲线下的面积"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdtewh0bs0","created":1790744135405,"text":"代价敏感错误率"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsf18ewxzs0","created":1790747569306,"text":"代价敏感错误率(cost-sensitive)公式为E(f;D;cost)=1/m(正例中被预测错误的总数乘以相应代价+反例中被预测错误的总数乘以相应的代价)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlseumlb05k0","created":1790747051618,"text":"代价曲线"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlseun4m4cw0","created":1790747052786,"text":"正例概率代价与归一化代价的关系曲线"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlseuubiw1s0","created":1790747068441,"text":"正例概率代价"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlseyy5sh7c0","created":1790747390258,"text":"全部样本中正例的比例"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsev6yeh480","created":1790747095946,"text":"归一化代价"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsezavf5sw0","created":1790747417929,"text":"与正例概率代价P(+)的关系式为costnorm=FNR*P(+)+FPR*(1-P(+))"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsevd0u1s00","created":1790747109153,"text":"期望总体代价"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsextnwbio0","created":1790747302105,"text":"正例概率代价与归一化代价的关系函数线下的面积"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}